      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.09,
          "end": 4.32,
          "en": "So let's start on the front end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.32,
          "end": 7.51,
          "en": "And let's start utilizing the answer to the question",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.51,
          "end": 11.65,
          "en": "whether a user is authenticated or not there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.65,
          "end": 14.54,
          "en": "For example, I wanna make sure that the options",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.54,
          "end": 16.78,
          "en": "in the header change based",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.78,
          "end": 20,
          "en": "on whether we are authenticated or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20,
          "end": 24.01,
          "en": "And again, Next.js makes that pretty easy for us.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 24.01,
          "end": 28.52,
          "en": "It is worth noting that after we locked in successfully,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 28.52,
          "end": 30.64,
          "en": "Next.js added a cookie.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 30.64,
          "end": 32.82,
          "en": "We can see this in the browser DevTools.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 32.82,
          "end": 34.71,
          "en": "If we go to application,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 34.71,
          "end": 37.23,
          "en": "cookies and select our domain.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 37.23,
          "end": 39.64,
          "en": "Here we see some cookies that were set",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 39.64,
          "end": 43.21,
          "en": "and these are cookies which are generated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 43.21,
          "end": 46.32,
          "en": "and managed by Next.js.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 46.32,
          "end": 48.27,
          "en": "For example this session token",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 48.27,
          "end": 51.053,
          "en": "is this Jason web token in the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 52.09,
          "end": 55.73,
          "en": "That was set automatically by Next.js",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 55.73,
          "end": 58.54,
          "en": "when we logged in successfully.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 58.54,
          "end": 63.54,
          "en": "And it will also use that token automatically for us,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 63.56,
          "end": 66.81,
          "en": "when we try to change what we see on the screen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 66.81,
          "end": 71.8,
          "en": "or when we try to send requests to protected resources.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 71.8,
          "end": 73.74,
          "en": "For example we can get the answer",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 73.74,
          "end": 76.47,
          "en": "to whether the user is locked in or not,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 76.47,
          "end": 80.36,
          "en": "by finding out whether it's such a valid token exists.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 80.36,
          "end": 82.51,
          "en": "And we could come up with some code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 82.51,
          "end": 85.64,
          "en": "that allows us to do that manually though",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 85.64,
          "end": 87.72,
          "en": "that code would involve that we need",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 87.72,
          "end": 90.69,
          "en": "to send that cookie to the server",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 90.69,
          "end": 94.19,
          "en": "and let the server decide whether it's valid or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 94.19,
          "end": 97.11,
          "en": "And hence, it's good that we don't have to do that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 97.11,
          "end": 98.97,
          "en": "Instead if you wanna find out,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 98.97,
          "end": 100.72999999999999,
          "en": "if the user using this page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 100.72999999999999,
          "end": 103.5,
          "en": "at the moment is authenticated or not,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 103.5,
          "end": 107.6,
          "en": "Next.js gives us a convenient way of doing that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 107.6,
          "end": 109.7,
          "en": "Let's say in our components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 109.7,
          "end": 111.78,
          "en": "in the main navigation component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 111.78,
          "end": 114.97,
          "en": "here I wanna show profile only",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 114.97,
          "end": 117.57,
          "en": "if the user is authenticated.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 117.57,
          "end": 119.55,
          "en": "Since we use Next off,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 119.55,
          "end": 123.98,
          "en": "all we have to do for that is we have to import something",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 123.98,
          "end": 126.72,
          "en": "from Next off client,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 126.72,
          "end": 131.09,
          "en": "and that's something now is to use session hook",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 131.09,
          "end": 135.59,
          "en": "which we can use an any functional React component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 135.59,
          "end": 140.23,
          "en": "Here we cannot call use session and use session",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 140.23,
          "end": 145.04,
          "en": "will return an array with exactly two elements.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 145.04,
          "end": 148.4,
          "en": "It is an array where the first element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 148.4,
          "end": 152.32999999999998,
          "en": "is the session object describing the act of session,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 152.32999999999998,
          "end": 155.41,
          "en": "and the second element is loading",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 155.41,
          "end": 157.97,
          "en": "which tells us wherever Next.js",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 157.97,
          "end": 160.17000000000002,
          "en": "is currently still figuring out",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 160.17000000000002,
          "end": 161.983,
          "en": "whether we are logged in or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 163.44,
          "end": 167.67000000000002,
          "en": "And then for the moment I'll just lock both all log loading",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 167.67000000000002,
          "end": 170.78300000000002,
          "en": "and I will log session.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 172.75,
          "end": 175.13,
          "en": "If we do that and save this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 175.13,
          "end": 176.92000000000002,
          "en": "and go back to the browser,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 176.92000000000002,
          "end": 179.57,
          "en": "to the console and reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 179.57,
          "end": 182.14,
          "en": "we see true and undefined and true",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 182.14,
          "end": 184.89,
          "en": "and some object and false in some object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 184.89,
          "end": 187.203,
          "en": "The first log is always the loading state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 188.32,
          "end": 190.63,
          "en": "So you'll see, initially we're loading,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 190.63,
          "end": 195.36,
          "en": "we are finding out whether the user is authenticated or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 195.36,
          "end": 197.87,
          "en": "And hence, we got no session object yet,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 197.87,
          "end": 200.01,
          "en": "then at some point we're still loading",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 200.01,
          "end": 202.19,
          "en": "but we actually do have that object yet,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 202.19,
          "end": 204.1,
          "en": "and hence then loading is false",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 204.1,
          "end": 206.27,
          "en": "and we have that object still.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 206.27,
          "end": 207.69,
          "en": "And in that session object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 207.69,
          "end": 212.32,
          "en": "we got that user data which we encoded into our token.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 212.32,
          "end": 214.76,
          "en": "And we got some expiration date",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 214.76,
          "end": 218.91,
          "en": "which tells us when that session will expire automatically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 218.91,
          "end": 220.82,
          "en": "Though it is worth noting",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 220.82,
          "end": 223.86,
          "en": "that this session will be prolonged automatically,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 223.86,
          "end": 226.7,
          "en": "if the user is active.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 226.7,
          "end": 228.49,
          "en": "So now that we know what's in there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 228.49,
          "end": 232.03,
          "en": "what we can do is we can change what we see based",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 232.03,
          "end": 234.96,
          "en": "on these two pieces of information.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 234.96,
          "end": 239.1,
          "en": "And we can make sure that the profile link is only showing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 239.1,
          "end": 241.36,
          "en": "up if we have of a session.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 241.36,
          "end": 244.45,
          "en": "So note if we're still finding it out,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 244.45,
          "end": 248.87,
          "en": "and also note if we found it out but the answer is no.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 248.87,
          "end": 250.72,
          "en": "Only if we have a session",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 250.72,
          "end": 255.72,
          "en": "then we showed this information in our header.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 256.12,
          "end": 258.21,
          "en": "So if I save this and reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 258.21,
          "end": 261.14,
          "en": "you'll see that profile flashes briefly",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 261.14,
          "end": 264.91,
          "en": "because it's only loaded after a very short time duration.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 264.91,
          "end": 268.89,
          "en": "Once we found out that we do have a session to be precise.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 268.89,
          "end": 271.75,
          "en": "Now that flashing could be unpleasant here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 271.75,
          "end": 274.81,
          "en": "and I'll come back to how we can optimize all",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 274.81,
          "end": 277.34000000000003,
          "en": "of that later in this section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 277.34000000000003,
          "end": 280.86,
          "en": "But that generally is how we can find out",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 280.86,
          "end": 283.63,
          "en": "whether we are authenticated or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 283.63,
          "end": 285.39,
          "en": "Now we can utilize this to then",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 285.39,
          "end": 286.227,
          "en": "for example, only show the log in link",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 286.227,
          "end": 290.23,
          "en": "if we don't have a session.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 290.23,
          "end": 292.1,
          "en": "Only if we don't have a session,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 292.1,
          "end": 294.15,
          "en": "we wanna show the log in link.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 294.15,
          "end": 296.27,
          "en": "I actually also don't wanna show it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 296.27,
          "end": 298.04,
          "en": "whilst we're still loading though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 298.04,
          "end": 301.14,
          "en": "So I wanna show it only if we don't have a session",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 301.14,
          "end": 303.1,
          "en": "and we're not loading.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 303.1,
          "end": 304.45,
          "en": "So for not loading,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 304.45,
          "end": 306.76,
          "en": "and we then know that we have no session,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 306.76,
          "end": 309.48,
          "en": "then I wanna show the log in link.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 309.48,
          "end": 311.07,
          "en": "For the log out button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 311.07,
          "end": 313.82,
          "en": "I only wanna show that if we do have a session",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 313.82,
          "end": 316.01,
          "en": "because logging out only makes sense",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 316.01,
          "end": 317.403,
          "en": "if we are logged in.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 318.73,
          "end": 320.05,
          "en": "With that out of the way,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 320.05,
          "end": 322.66,
          "en": "you'll see the log in link is now gone.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 322.66,
          "end": 325.58,
          "en": "Now I am still on the log in page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 325.58,
          "end": 328.26,
          "en": "because I can still visit that page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 328.26,
          "end": 331.18,
          "en": "I'll show how we can prevent this later as well,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 331.18,
          "end": 333.9,
          "en": "but we now at least know how we can control",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 333.9,
          "end": 336.8,
          "en": "what we see on the user interface.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 336.8,
          "end": 339.54,
          "en": "And that is an important first step.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 339.54,
          "end": 343.40999999999997,
          "en": "Now, before we dive deeper into route protection",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 343.40999999999997,
          "end": 346.8,
          "en": "and how we can control which pages can be visited,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 346.8,
          "end": 349.12,
          "en": "and how we can optimize all of that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 349.12,
          "end": 351.90999999999997,
          "en": "let's first of all, explore how we can log out",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 351.90999999999997,
          "end": 355.373,
          "en": "so that we can also go back to log out state.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
